kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/96157c833833172e23ec88b638f009af.mp4?t=1788157420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live-Action Scenes &amp; Star-Studded Cast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All scenes are shot on custom-built real-life sets. Renowned actors Xu Yue, Zhang Xiaochen, Zuo Xiaoqing, Zhang Qi and more join the cast, delivering vivid portrayals of court intrigue and battlefield heroism. They stand beside you through this chaotic era, marching forth toward a blood-soaked homeland together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/b424361be7060bb5ea3d807e423fae9a.poster.avif?t=1788157420\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/b424361be7060bb5ea3d807e423fae9a.webm?t=1788157420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/b424361be7060bb5ea3d807e423fae9a.mp4?t=1788157420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/8cf84bdf52506f0074d2f24972bc60b3.poster.avif?t=1788157420\" width=1170 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/8cf84bdf52506f0074d2f24972bc60b3.webm?t=1788157420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/8cf84bdf52506f0074d2f24972bc60b3.mp4?t=1788157420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 10 Hours of Live-Action Story Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless branching paths unlock diverse endings, with secret conclusions and surprise plot twists waiting to be uncovered. The game blends QTE interactions and SLG, pulling you straight into the action rather than letting you merely observe from afar. Every decision you make alters the course of the northern campaign, shifts the fate of the Song Dynasty, and forges your one-of-a-kind Shaosong legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/6e926cb295c95fd97cb881d35394253b.poster.avif?t=1788157420\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/6e926cb295c95fd97cb881d35394253b.webm?t=1788157420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/extras/6e926cb295c95fd97cb881d35394253b.mp4?t=1788157420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings, fellow lords! We are the development team behind Shao Song I. We are a group of IP fans deeply moved by the core belief from the original novel: <i>The Song may fall, but the realm shall not perish</i>. This shared passion for the story brought us together to explore new possibilities blending history with interactive storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim for Shao Song I to be far more than a live-action interactive title. We hope it serves as a window for global players to experience the unique devotion to nation and unyielding integrity found within Eastern history, delivering an unforgettable journey through the Song Dynasty for all interactive narrative enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As loyal fans of the original novel, we have refined this game with utmost reverence. Liudan Paishui, the original author, has also fully supported our creative process to preserve the authentic soul of the story. Here, you will embody Emperor Gaozong Zhao Gou, live through the chaotic age of shattered homelands, uphold the oath that <i>The Song may fall, but the realm shall not perish</i>, and personally avenge the eternal grievances of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still undergoing continuous optimization. Add it to your Wishlist to show your support. We look forward to meeting you soon to ride the tempest of the Shao Song I era side by side.</p>", "short_description": "Experience an immersive live-action historical game. Reincarnate as Southern Song’s controversial Emperor Zhao Gou, where every choice shapes the dynasty’s fate. Amid Jingkang’s ruin, defy destiny, restore your homeland and stand firm with the oath: The Song may fall, but the realm shall never fall!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/dfd52caf6453e43b4d613a662064aca4924a7858/header.jpg?t=1788157420", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/f28bc20a58175ed3e167b6a1b6e17d341e2e9bef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788157420", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292950/f28bc20a58175ed3e167b6a1b6e17d341e2e9bef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788157420", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 集成显卡<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>",